  skillDescription: "Red Hat b\u1EBB cong d\xF2ng ch\u1EA3y c\u1EE7a th\u1EDDi gian,
    bu\u1ED9c to\xE0n b\u1ED9 chi\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng r\u01A1i v\xE0o tr\u1EA1ng
